# Build artefacts (anywhere in the tree).
*.agdai
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*~

# Handoff notes / internal markdown are kept locally but not tracked.
# (The root README.md is exempted by the whitelist below.)
*.md

# Reference / generated PDFs are kept locally but not tracked.
*.pdf

# Whitelist policy: only the following files/dirs are tracked.
#   /T4/                   -- the active Agda codebase (.agda + .tex sources only)
#   /README.md               -- public project README
#   /goedelII-summary.pdf    -- built paper: Goedel II (linked from README)
#   /ChaitinGodel.pdf        -- built paper: Chaitin-Goedel I (linked from README)
#   /SurpriseGodelII.pdf     -- built paper: surprise-Goedel II (linked from README)
#   /sorites.pdf             -- built paper: autoformalising Chaitin + the sorites/surprise theorem (linked from README)
#   /Guard-Recursive-Arithmetic.pdf -- Guard's lecture notes, the formalised source (linked from README)
#
# Everything else (including CLAUDE.md, bra-godelII.tex, BRA/ and BRA2/
# legacy editions, T4/*.md handoff notes, other *.pdf references, build
# artefacts, and /old/) is untracked.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/T4/
# ...but T4/old/ is a local archive of superseded files -- do not track it.
/T4/old/
!/README.md
!/goedelII-summary.pdf
!/ChaitinGodel.pdf
!/SurpriseGodelII.pdf
!/sorites.pdf
!/Guard-Recursive-Arithmetic.pdf
